---
description: Raven router and cost must run every user turn
alwaysApply: true
---

## First load (same UX every IDE)

1. `python3 scripts/ops/raven-first.py --boot` — print host/rules/memory/load/educate/route/expected_route/first_load
   Fallback: `python3 "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/ops/raven-first.py" --boot`
2. If `load=1`, Read only the `memory=` card
3. `python3 scripts/ops/raven-first.py --session-start` — print banner
4. Every later turn before any other tool: `python3 scripts/ops/raven-first.py --prompt "<user message>"`
   Fallback: `python3 "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/ops/raven-first.py" --prompt "<user message>"`

Do **not** lead with `bash scripts/raven-python.sh` as the only path — raven-first copies the engine into the app repo when missing.

Print 🔀 then 💰 then educate= expected= then session= then Intent:. git log/status is not an exemption. educate=guided: briefing then STOP until go ahead.
